    ('admin.product_pricing.apply.hint', 'zh-CN', '规则参数只取当前规则类型用得上的那一格：成本乘倍数填 multiplier，成本加价与统一售价填 amount，目标毛利率填 margin（0.3 表示 30%）。筛选集范围必须指定工程（页面顶部切换），空筛选不会全表改价；单批命中商品数有上限，超过请收紧条件。未填成本价的变体按成本类规则会被跳过（预览里标出原因），其余变体照常处理。', 200, 'admin', 'admin/product_pricing.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.product_pricing.apply.hint', 'en-US', 'Only the field that the selected rule type uses is read: multiplier for cost × multiplier, amount for cost + markup and flat price, margin for target gross margin (0.3 means 30%). The filter scope requires a project (switch it at the top of the page); an empty filter never reprices the whole table. There is a cap on how many products one run may match; tighten the conditions if you exceed it. Variants without a cost price are skipped by cost-based rules (the preview shows the reason); all other variants are processed normally.', 200, 'admin', 'admin/product_pricing.html', 1, now(), now()),
