    ('admin.product_tags.intro', 'zh-CN', '手工标签由人工挂到商品；自动标签只接受内置规则类型 + 参数（不接受自由表达式），归属在明确的重算时机更新：商品写操作后、变体写操作后、标签规则变更后，以及这里的「重算」按钮。重算只替换该自动标签自己的归属，不会覆盖手工标签。', 200, 'admin', 'admin/product_tags.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.product_tags.intro', 'en-US', 'Manual tags are attached to products by hand; automatic tags only accept the built-in rule types and their parameters (no free-form expressions), and their memberships are refreshed at well-defined moments: after a product write, after a variant write, after a tag rule changes, and when you press Recalculate here. A recalculation only replaces the memberships of that automatic tag; manual tags are never overwritten.', 200, 'admin', 'admin/product_tags.html', 1, now(), now()),
