    ('admin.inventory.warehouse.mid', 'zh-CN', '作为「未指定仓库」时的兜底。新建变体时选中的仓库即为该 SKU 的归属仓，系统会在那里生成一条库存记录（初始 0）；SKU 编码以归属仓短码开头（如 ', 200, 'admin', 'admin/inventory.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.inventory.warehouse.mid', 'en-US', ' to fall back on when none is specified. The warehouse selected when a variant is created becomes the owning warehouse of that SKU, and a stock record is created there (starting at 0); the SKU code starts with the owning warehouse''s short code (e.g. ', 200, 'admin', 'admin/inventory.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.inventory.warehouse.mid2', 'zh-CN', '）—— 前缀表达的是默认发货仓，不是「这个 SKU 只属于这个仓」，同一个 SKU 可以在多个仓各有一行库存。', 200, 'admin', 'admin/inventory.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.inventory.warehouse.mid2', 'en-US', ') — that prefix expresses the default shipping warehouse, not "this SKU only belongs to that warehouse": the same SKU can have one stock row in each of several warehouses.', 200, 'admin', 'admin/inventory.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.inventory.source.lead', 'zh-CN', '库存以「SKU × 仓库」为维度，这里显示的是', 200, 'admin', 'admin/inventory.html', 1, now(), now()),
