    ('admin.inventory_purchases.intro.tail', 'zh-CN', '由收货原子递增，单据状态（未入库 / 部分入库 / 已入库）直接由「已入库数量 与 采购数量」推出 —— 没有人工改状态的入口。', 200, 'admin', 'admin/inventory_purchases.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.inventory_purchases.intro.tail', 'en-US', ' on a line is increased atomically by each receipt, and the document status (not received / partially received / received) is derived from the received quantity against the ordered quantity — there is no manual status field to set.', 200, 'admin', 'admin/inventory_purchases.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.inventory_purchases.receipt.lead', 'zh-CN', '登记入库会做三件事：经', 200, 'admin', 'admin/inventory_purchases.html', 1, now(), now()),
