    ('admin.inventory_sources.intro.mid2', 'en-US', ' separates internal from external — internal sources report under the internal trading convention and may carry an internal settlement price (your own factory receives through production, with no purchase order); the ', 200, 'admin', 'admin/inventory_sources.html', 1, now(), now()),
