    ('admin.inventory_sources.intro.tail', 'zh-CN', '独立于类型，是「这笔交易是不是关联交易」的判据，报表按「类型 × 关联方」两维交叉取数。外部供应商也可以被标成关联方（同一实控人下的另一家公司）。', 200, 'admin', 'admin/inventory_sources.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.inventory_sources.intro.tail', 'en-US', ' is independent of the type and is the test for "is this transaction a related-party transaction". Reports cross-tabulate type × related party. An external supplier can be flagged as a related party too (another company under the same ultimate controller).', 200, 'admin', 'admin/inventory_sources.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.inventory_sources.intro2.lead', 'zh-CN', '不同来源的字段形状天然不同，异构的对接信息统一放进', 200, 'admin', 'admin/inventory_sources.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.inventory_sources.intro2.lead', 'en-US', 'Different sources naturally have different field shapes, so heterogeneous integration details all go into the ', 200, 'admin', 'admin/inventory_sources.html', 1, now(), now()),
