    ('admin.inventory_sources.intro2.tail', 'zh-CN', '：类型 / 关联方 / 结算价 / 状态都必须结构化（报表要按它们分组、采购单要按它们校验），只有对接配置是自由形状。', 200, 'admin', 'admin/inventory_sources.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.inventory_sources.intro2.tail', 'en-US', ': type / related party / settlement price / status must all be structured (reports group by them and purchase orders validate against them); only the integration config has a free shape.', 200, 'admin', 'admin/inventory_sources.html', 1, now(), now()),
